# Demo recording intermediates now go under the system temp dir, not the tree --
# see scripts/demo/paths.py. The one MP4 that ships (site/axonllm-demo.mp4) is
# committed deliberately, because site/ is uploaded to S3 with no build step.
# Nothing here needs ignoring; a stray demo MP4 should show up as untracked
# rather than vanish silently.
